# Cline rules — read AGENTS.md first

Before any change in this repo, read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) (project entry for AI agents) and keep its hard rules:

- Never run `git commit`/`git push` unless the user explicitly asks in this session.
- Never write real credentials (DB password, SECRET_TOKEN, zarinpal merchant id) into files, diffs, or docs.
- Repo is CRLF — preserve line endings; beware `\n`-only replacements silently no-oping.
- CSS edits to `assets/css/anbar-refresh.css` require bumping `?v=N` in all 5 header partials under `views/partial/`.
- Do not restructure the legacy `auto_prepend_file` / `pagename()` architecture.
- **Knowledge maintenance (see AGENTS.md "Knowledge maintenance"):** before ending a session, record durable findings — facts → `docs/PROJECT.md`, unfixed bugs → `docs/BACKLOG.md`, traps → `AGENTS.md` — fix stale claims, never record secrets.

Deep reference: [docs/PROJECT.md](docs/PROJECT.md) · Open work: [docs/BACKLOG.md](docs/BACKLOG.md)
